      "type": "title",
      "text": "Acme Industrial Systems 2026年第三季度供应商评审纪要",
      "order": 0,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "会议日期：2026年10月15日",
      "order": 1,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "一、产品与产能",
      "order": 2,
      "page": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Acme（Acme Industrial Systems Ltd.）表示，2026年三季度已在华东新增两条伺服模块装配线。",
      "order": 3,
      "page": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "一、产品与产能"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Servo Module X1（物料号 SERVO-MODULE-X1）由 Acme 供应，定位为中端伺服模块，用于标准装配单元。",
      "order": 4,
      "page": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "一、产品与产能"
      ]
    },
